      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which of the following values is **not** in the range of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x?$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14274762/assets/df22eea4331c47da3047381ca672fd80ebf75118054316fe88c0e2d96dae0d34.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The range of the function is $y\\in [-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{\\pi }{2}].$\n\nTherefore, the value $y=\\pi $ is not in the range of the function.",
